---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Oasis Dental Care"
  description="What information Oasis Dental Care's website collects, how it's used, and who it's shared with."
  page="privacy-policy"
>

<section class="phero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag">/ Privacy Policy</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated August 2026. This covers this website only — not the treatment records kept as part of your care at our office, which are handled under separate healthcare privacy protections.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pad">
  <div class="wrap-narrow prose reveal in">
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you fill out and send the appointment request form on our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--teal)">Contact page</a>, we collect what you enter: your first and last name, email address, phone number (optional), the service you're interested in (optional), a preferred date or time (optional), and any message you write. We don't use cookies or tracking scripts to collect this — it's only what you type into the form and submit.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use this information only to respond to your appointment request or question and to schedule or manage that appointment. We don't send marketing emails from it, and we don't share it with any third party for their own marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2>How submissions are handled</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are sent by email through <a href="https://resend.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--teal)">Resend</a>, an email delivery service, to our practice inbox. Nothing you submit is stored in a database on this website — once it's emailed to us, it exists only in our practice email account and in Resend's delivery logs, which Resend handles under its own privacy policy.</p>

    <h2>Other services on this site</h2>
    <p>This site loads fonts from Google Fonts and embeds a Google Maps view of our office on the Home and Contact pages. Loading either one means your browser makes a direct request to Google, which may involve Google receiving your IP address under its own <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--teal)">privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
    <p>This website does not currently use cookies or analytics tools to track visitors. If that changes — for example, if we add Google Analytics in the future — we'll update this page to describe what's collected.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep appointment request emails as long as needed to respond to you and for our ordinary scheduling records.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>To ask what information we have from a form submission, or to have it deleted from our email records, contact us at <a href="mailto:oasisdentalcarehb@yahoo.com" style="color:var(--teal)">oasisdentalcarehb@yahoo.com</a> or <a href="tel:7148932106" style="color:var(--teal)">(714) 893-2106</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This website is not directed at children, and we don't knowingly collect information from anyone under 13.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this page from time to time. The date at the top reflects the most recent update.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>Oasis Dental Care, 6552 Bolsa Ave, Suite J, Huntington Beach, CA 92647 — <a href="tel:7148932106" style="color:var(--teal)">(714) 893-2106</a> — <a href="mailto:oasisdentalcarehb@yahoo.com" style="color:var(--teal)">oasisdentalcarehb@yahoo.com</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
